# Everything under output/ is a run artefact: frames from a real desk, logs
# and scratch scripts carrying absolute home paths. Listing the subfolders
# one at a time left `output/pr748-review/` addable, and an `add -A` took
# 402 of them — screenshots included. The directory is the unit.
output/
